# UPGRADE-11

# Real PostgreSQL Tenant-Isolation Proof,

# Release Integrity, Multi-Region Reliability,

# Data-Residency Enforcement, Encryption Boundary,

# Retention / Legal-Hold Architecture,

# and Enterprise Compliance Evidence

You are operating directly inside the current ZCoder repository after
Upgrade-10.

DO NOT begin by adding new features.

Upgrade-10 contains evidence contradictions that must be corrected first.

The mission has four ordered stages:

1. eliminate false or ambiguous verification claims;
2. prove enterprise tenant isolation against real PostgreSQL;
3. establish a truthful multi-region / HA / data-residency architecture;
4. build auditable enterprise control evidence without falsely claiming certification.

================================================================
P0 — UPGRADE-10 EVIDENCE CORRECTION
===================================

The previous report contains contradictory evidence.

Reported summary:

703 tests passed
2 optional skips

Later execution output shows multiple PostgreSQL tests skipped because:

PostgreSQL test container not reachable

The CLI also reportedly prints:

AI Model Coder CLI v1.39.0

while release documentation reports:

1.40.0

Treat these as P0 release-integrity defects.

Before modifying functionality, run:

git status --short
git log -30 --oneline
git tag --sort=-version:refname | head -30

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python main.py --help

python -m build
git diff --check

Record exact:

PASSED
FAILED
SKIPPED
XFAILED
XPASSED
DESELECTED

Never summarize skipped PostgreSQL tests as optional unless they actually
belong to an explicitly optional test class.

================================================================

1. TEST CLASSIFICATION
   ================================================================

Classify tests into:

UNIT
INTEGRATION
POSTGRES_REQUIRED
SYSTEM
OPTIONAL_UI
LIVE_EXTERNAL

Release-critical PostgreSQL tenant security tests must NOT silently skip
because PostgreSQL is unavailable.

For a production/enterprise release gate:

PostgreSQL missing
→ POSTGRES_REQUIRED = UNKNOWN/FAIL

not:

PASS

Default lightweight developer tests may skip appropriately.

Release CI must provision PostgreSQL automatically.

================================================================
2. FIX TEST COUNT TRUTH
=======================

The release report must derive totals from actual pytest output.

Do not manually hardcode:

703 passed
2 skipped

Generate machine-readable test evidence where practical.

Release gate should distinguish:

required_skips
optional_skips
live_external_skips

Any required skip:

FINAL cannot be unconditional PASS.

================================================================
