=================================

Find every version source:

pyproject.toml
main.py
**version**
package metadata
CLI
Helm
Docker labels
docs
CHANGELOG
release gate

Choose ONE canonical version source.

All other consumers derive from it.

Add regression test:

# package_version

# CLI_version

release_gate_version

Build wheel and execute the installed artifact from outside the repo.

Verify:

zcoder --version

Do not test only:

python main.py --version

