restore tested
PITR tested

These are four different evidence states.

================================================================
68. PITR CLOSURE
================

Upgrade-10 still reports PITR limitation.

If this upgrade claims full PITR:

provision real WAL archive target
create base backup
generate transactions
select recovery point
destroy/change data after point
restore to fresh PostgreSQL
recover to target
verify expected dataset

Anything less:

PITR remains PASS_WITH_LIMITATIONS / NOT_PROVEN.

================================================================
69. RESTORE DRILL EVIDENCE
==========================

Persist:

backup ID
restore environment
duration
records verified
result
timestamp

Do not record only:

