104. RELEASE GATE REQUIRED-SKIP RULE
====================================

If any release-critical PostgreSQL/security test is skipped:

POSTGRES_REQUIRED = UNKNOWN/FAIL

FINAL cannot be PASS.

Optional TUI/Web tests may remain classified independently.

