RLS
cross-tenant
quota concurrency
multi-process
backup/restore
regional policy
network failure
release gate

Do not hide skipped required tests.

================================================================
111. VERSION DECISION
=====================

Resolve the current mismatch.

Report:

canonical source
old CLI version
old package version
new chosen version
Git tag state
published release state

Explain SemVer reasoning.

The version mismatch itself must be impossible after this upgrade.

================================================================
112. DEFINITION OF DONE
=======================

Upgrade-11 is complete only when:

[ ] test totals come from actual execution
[ ] required PostgreSQL tests cannot silently skip in release CI
[ ] CLI/package/release version is identical
[ ] real PostgreSQL tenant tests execute
[ ] actual RLS policies are verified
[ ] app role cannot bypass RLS
[ ] pool contamination test passes
[ ] full cross-tenant matrix passes
[ ] background processing is tenant-safe
[ ] realtime is tenant-safe
[ ] artifacts/caches are tenant-safe
[ ] quota race is tested with PostgreSQL concurrency
[ ] backup restore preserves RLS/isolation
[ ] region concepts are separated correctly
[ ] tenant residency policy exists
[ ] scheduler enforces allowed regions
[ ] failover cannot violate residency
[ ] encryption architecture is explicit
[ ] no custom cryptography is introduced
[ ] retention executor is tenant-safe
[ ] legal-hold boundary does not falsely claim compliance
[ ] control catalog exists
[ ] evidence records are freshness-aware
[ ] evidence status cannot be fabricated by booleans
[ ] PITR claim accurately reflects actual executed proof
[ ] final verdict preserves limitations
[ ] no P0/P1 tenant-security defect remains

