external compliance certification?

## 27. Final Verdict

Do NOT say:

FULLY VERIFIED
MULTI-REGION READY
HA
ACTIVE-ACTIVE
COMPLIANT
SOC 2 COMPLIANT
ISO 27001 CERTIFIED
PITR VERIFIED
TENANT ISOLATION PROVEN

unless the exact property has the exact executed evidence required for
that claim.

The highest priority of Upgrade-11 is not feature count.

It is making every security, reliability, tenancy, region, version and
compliance statement traceable to reproducible evidence.
